event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":"[SEMICOLON: ;]`.\n\n### 2. Syntax Analysis (Parsing)\nOnce the tokens are generated, they are passed to the **Syntax","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

